<spell-notebook "counter notebook">
	# Counter
	A button that counts its clicks.

	## Counter
	A counter starts at 0, and adds one each time it's clicked.
	<example "One counter">
		<counter/>
	</example>

	## Several counters
	Each counter keeps its own count:  clicking one leaves the others alone.
	<section>
		<example "Two counters">
			<counter/>
			<counter/>
		</example>
		<text color="grey">Click either one.</text>
	</section>
</spell-notebook>
